TI  - Increase in Kelch 13 Polymorphisms in Plasmodium falciparum, Southern Rwanda.
PG  - 294-296
LID - 10.3201/eid2701.203527 [doi]
AB  - Artemisinin resistance in Plasmodium falciparum is associated with nonsynonymous 
      mutations in the Kelch 13 (K13) propeller domain. We found that 12.1% (8/66) of 
      clinical P. falciparum isolates from Huye district, Rwanda, exhibited K13 
      mutations, including R561H, a validated resistance marker. K13 mutations appear 
      to be increasing in this region.
